  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/3c918faea95ad2b282bee4f9828dc521d4f578736f37095c0be739346f8ac685.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>150</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>360</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>150</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vẽ hình chữ nhật <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>150</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì vật đứng yên nên tổng hợp lực tác động vào vật bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Do vật đứng yên nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Lại có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Theo đề cho, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
